{"id":"medium-005","difficulty":"medium","title":"移动零","description":"将所有 0 移到末尾，保持非零相对顺序，原地修改。","function_signature":"def move_zeroes(nums: list) -> list","entry_point":"move_zeroes","language":"python","constraints":"1 <= len(nums) <= 10^4","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(n)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["全零","无零","单元素"],"public_tests":[{"args":[[0,1,0,3,12]],"expected":[1,3,12,0,0]},{"args":[[0]],"expected":[0]},{"args":[[1,2]],"expected":[1,2]}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[[0,0,1]],"expected":[1,0,0]},{"args":[[0,0,0]],"expected":[0,0,0]},{"args":[[2,0,0,1]],"expected":[2,1,0,0]}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"过滤非零再补零。","复杂度分析":"时间 O(n)，空间 O(n)。","关键边界与处理策略":"全零、无零均可。","代码实现":"```python\ndef move_zeroes(nums: list) -> list:\n    nonzero = [x for x in nums if x != 0]\n    return nonzero + [0] * (len(nums) - len(nonzero))\n```","自测说明":"公开用例通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":false,"first_error_step":"step_2_complexity","error_types":["复杂度分析错误"],"note":"额外 O(n) 空间"}}